==Etymology==
Eatle's name is a portmanteau of "eat",{{Refn|[[:File:Fasttrack Physically Stronger Than XLR8.PNG]]|group=MW|name=eat}} the primary ability he has, and "[[Wikipedia:Beetle|beetle]]", the insect he is based on. His name also roughly sounds like "eat all".

==Trivia==
[[File:GfT (45).png|thumb|The golf course statue]]
*The red robot-like statue of the golf course from ''[[Greetings From Techadon]]'' bears a resemblance to Eatle's design in '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]'''.
*In '''Ultimate Alien''', Eatle's mouth only ever opened when he was about to devour something and never actually opened when he talked. Much like [[Lodestar]], however, Eatle's mouth now moves when he speaks in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''.
*Eatle is one of the four regular aliens to get a complete redesign in '''Omniverse'''; the others being [[Shocksquatch]], [[Swampfire]], and [[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]].
*Eatle's existence was first brought to light in a listing for the '''Ultimate Alien''' four-inch line.{{Refn|[[:File:Eatle first mention.png]]|group = Bandai}}
*Matt Wayne believed Eatle closer resembled a rhino.{{Refn|name=eat|group=MW}}
*As with the other regular aliens introduced in Season 3 of '''Ultimate Alien''', Eatle was created at the request of the studio.
**Several artists were asked to draw rough concepts without being given direction or powers,{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick was not told Eatle's powers.png]]|group = DJW}} as the studio did not want them feeling handcuffed for ideas. What was turned in is what springboarded the idea for the final designs.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate alien season 3 aliens origins.png]]|group = TJC|name=Eatleorigin}}
**Some of Derrick's initial roughs shows him with four arms and a horn similar in appearance to the one featured later in '''Omniverse'''.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick ua eatle concept.png]]|group = ca}}
***Although some of Derrick's concept art for Eatle in '''Ultimate Alien''' depicts his [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol with prongs indicative of an [[Ultimate Forms|Ultimate form]], this was a mistake on Derrick's end, and an Ultimate form of Eatle was never planned.{{Refn|[[:File:DJW Eatle not Ultimate Eatle 1.PNG]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:DJW Eatle not Ultimate Eatle 2.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
**After Derrick turned in his beetle concept, [[Glen Murakami]] liked the design and tried to figure out powers to match. Then, the writers and designers had brainstorming sessions until the final eating-based powers and designs were reached.{{Refn|group = TJC|name=Eatleorigin}}
**Eatle's final design for '''Ultimate Alien''' was created by [[Chap Yaep]].{{Refn|[[:File:Chap Yaep Designed UA Eatle.png]]|group = TJC}}
**Concept art Eatle's appearance in '''Omniverse''' was done by Derrick. It shows him as being more animalistic by standing on all fours with the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on the top of his horn.{{Refn|[[:File:Eatle Concept Art.png]]|group = ca}} Derrick later lamented that he took it too far.{{Refn|group = DJW|[[:File:Derrick's Eatle Retrospection.png]]}}
**Eatle's final design for '''Omniverse''' was created by [[Steven Choi]].{{Refn|[[:File:Steven choi designed OV eatle.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
**Derrick speculated that the reason why Eatle's prototype figure for '''Omniverse''' looks so different from his actual design was because he was probably based on rough drawings.{{Refn|[[:File:OV eatle prototype toy info.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Eatle was originally supposed to fight [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'' instead of [[Julie Yamamoto|Julie]] and [[Ship]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/d/d4/Night_of_the_Living_Nightmare_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Night of the Living Nightmare'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = first}} His role was taken by [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]] and [[Ultimate Spidermonkey]] in the final version of the episode.
*Despite the confirmed existence of Eatle's predator, it was a concept that ultimately never made it into the show.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = predator}}{{Refn|[[:File:Eatle's Predator.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

